## §8 FULL PATCH — commit `8f758b20` (single commit, no seams)

- Base: `52f13489` (origin/main S186c/e) · apply: `git am 0001-S188-*.patch`
- Bytes: 116,642 · SHA256: `bc86cdb3ec600d2d`-prefix — verify byte-exact before applying (W3 seam law: reject on ANY mismatch, request re-post, never hand-repair).
- Posted in 2 parts (comment size limit); the concatenation of PART 1/2 + PART 2/2 (minus the two bracketed markers) IS the byte-exact patch.

